priority: -2
max-visits: 1

= Hoover Moratorium

In light of the [? if not emergency_decree_seen: current economic situation?][? if emergency_decree_seen: Askew's appeal for relief?], and the Commonwealth banking crisis, President Herbert Hoover of the <span style="color: #B31942;">United</span> <span style="color: #0A3161;">States</span> has issued a moratorium on war debt payments from the Great War, including the Commonwealth's. Our budget situation should improve somewhat.

[? if marcher_in_government and foreign_minister_party == "Marcher": Even though this is not our accomplishment, our foreign ministry is eager to take credit for this accomplishment. ?][? if not marcher_in_government and foreign_minister_party != "Marcher": Even though this is not the work of the foreign ministry, it is eager to take credit for this accomplishment. ?]

